E AX3058 630-region-name-shadowed.ax:23:15-16 region-name-shadowed "region `r` is already open: a nested region cannot reuse an enclosing region's name" #"`r` is already the name of an enclosing region" !"lexical region names identify reset extents; signature annotations such as `@r` describe lifetime relationships and do not select an allocation arena" ?"rename the inner region: regions are ordered by nesting (MM-RGN-2), and a name that means two extents cannot be ordered"
